[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8700.87, "timestamp": "02:25:00", "text": "我的频道近期不会有任何变化。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8704.03, "timestamp": "02:25:04", "text": "一直试图喂它们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8707.429, "timestamp": "02:25:07", "text": "人们。我的天啊。太有创意了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8709.23, "timestamp": "02:25:09", "text": "你做得真聪明"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8713.03, "timestamp": "02:25:13", "text": "它。与此同时，我和这个人在一起就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8716.07, "timestamp": "02:25:16", "text": "一年多了，我还是忍不住要说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8718.63, "timestamp": "02:25:18", "text": "关闭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8722.469, "timestamp": "02:25:22", "text": "凉爽的。我不知道。我确实想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8724.55, "timestamp": "02:25:24", "text": "是的，我也对此感到担忧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8729.469, "timestamp": "02:25:29", "text": "如果是条小蛇之类的东西呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8732.95, "timestamp": "02:25:32", "text": "直接舔一下外面或者直接用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8735.67, "timestamp": "02:25:35", "text": "就是这样吗？或者他们根本无法直接使用它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8738.63, "timestamp": "02:25:38", "text": "不，我绝不会允许这种情况发生。我会去狩猎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8741.23, "timestamp": "02:25:41", "text": "你倒下了。不用担心。我会抱着你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8745.429, "timestamp": "02:25:45", "text": "如果有人偷走它，就把它扔掉。是的。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8748.389, "timestamp": "02:25:48", "text": "但是，嗯，我当时挺担心的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8753.67, "timestamp": "02:25:53", "text": "因为嗯，在推特上，伊恩和油管博主"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8755.99, "timestamp": "02:25:55", "text": "推特上的那些闹剧和乱七八糟的事儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8759.59, "timestamp": "02:25:59", "text": "复制和所有相关的东西。我是我的"}]